WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:22.770
Rishido, time to die.

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:28.880
Bakura?

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:31.570
I brought a friend.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:34.470
Your other personality.

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:36.910
Marik's other part.

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:38.750
Die!

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:45.050
Stay there.

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:48.440
I'll deal with you after I get rid of Rishido.

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:52.200
My arm!

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:53.530
You!

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:01.100
We were both chosen by the Millennium Items.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:04.500
We must settle this in a Shadow Game.

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:07.940
I'm looking forward to it.

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:13.950
Marik vs Bakura

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:36.700
Mai...

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:40.330
Mai!

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:42.090
Jonouchi.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.340
You made me worry.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:46.880
You're fine now, right Mai?

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:51.330
Jonouchi, you're a duelist who can stand on his own.

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:54.350
I'm glad to have met you.

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:55.250
Goodbye.

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:57.200
Mai!

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:59.510
Mai!

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:04.280
Damn...  Just wait, Mai.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:31.310
Ra has three effects.

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:37.140
I don't know why I was able to read the hieratic text on the God Card.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:41.400
But for now, I have to focus on figuring out how to defeat Ra.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:46.360
A shadow duel.

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:49.540
The loser vanishes in this game of death.

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:54.850
And it'll be you, Bakura.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:59.540
Keep talking.  You won't be able to when I bury you.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:06.520
Bakura lost to Slifer in his first match against Yugi.

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:24.810
That means he was sleeping in his bed when I defeated the woman in the third match.

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:31.840
So Bakura doesn't know what my God Card, The Winged Dragon of Ra, can do.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:39.080
I can see that my host's personality is inside you.

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:40.800
So you've noticed.

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:45.460
Yes.  Your other half is my partner.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:49.630
That means I know what's in your deck.

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:57.540
Too bad, but I remade my deck when we swapped personalities.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:02.050
I know that you have a God Card.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.370
So what?

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:08.820
That doesn't mean you know how to destroy it.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:13.440
So go ahead and discuss with your partner to create a useless strategy.

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:17.060
Let's start the duel, Bakura!

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.060
Hold on!

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:22.300
Your other half wants to talk first.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:23.470
What?

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:28.710
You're the evil that I created.

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:29.940
That's right.

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:39.720
I'm the evil crystallization of the darkness, anger, hatred and jealousy in your heart.

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:43.620
But Rishido sealed you away.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:49.450
Now that I'm out, your heart must feel lighter.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:53.000
You should thank me.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:06:00.540
When the Millennium Rod implants my mind into others, they keeps providing me with the latest info.

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:05.840
Since I mind controlled Anzu, I've learned everything through her.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:10.400
My sister talked about the horrible truth behind the Ishtar family.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:14.480
I'll kill you first, Father.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:18.200
Don't!

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:22.590
You killed my father.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:26.360
C'mon now.  You and I share a body.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:29.720
Don't act innocent whenever it suits you.

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:31.420
You're as guilty as me.

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:32.640
That's true.

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:35.960
My heart created this tragedy.

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:39.010
Father, what have I done?

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:40.950
My sympathies.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.580
Five years ago...

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:48.690
You're...

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:54.920
The soul of the great Pharaoh gave you this destiny.

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:58.740
The Pharaoh will resurrect soon.

00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:01.860
Find the Pharaoh, Marik.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:11.160
I thought he was the one who carried on the Pharaoh's will and killed my father.

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:13.800
But I was wrong.

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.880
So what will you do?

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:21.650
I will atone to my father by burying you.

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.190
Interesting.  Try it!

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:30.190
The man in the turban who appeared in Marik's mind was definitely Shadi.

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:33.200
But five years ago, he was already...

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:34.930
Here I go, Bakura!

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:37.330
I'll provide support!

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:40.400
Be quiet!  Don't order me around!

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:43.510
All you need to do is fulfill our agreement!

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:47.910
I know.  If you defeat him, you can have the Millennium Rod.

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:49.570
There's more.

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:52.650
You'll tell me what's tattooed on your back.

00:07:54.250 --> 00:08:01.130
I thought I'll get the dark powers if I place the seven Millennium Items in the tablet.

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:02.360
But that's not true.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:08.470
The doors won't open unless I decipher the tattoos on your back.

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:11.360
You can't keep me in the dark forever.

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:13.680
Fine.  I promise.

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.140
And one more thing!

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:18.870
Do you care if I burn your body into ashes?

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:20.040
I don't care!

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:22.660
That's good to hear.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:25.520
I don't have to worry about killing him!

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:28.760
Finished discussing?

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:32.220
Whatever you discussed, it's a waste of time.

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:35.920
I'll bury you both!

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:39.250
The shadow duel begins!

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:49.550
This shadow duel is the ultimate death game where the shadows devour the loser's body and soul!

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:51.260
Devour the body?

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:52.880
You'll understand.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:57.250
Duel!

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:00.380
Here I go!

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:02.250
I go first!  I draw!

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:07.260
I'll set a powerful trap card from the start.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:10.500
I know what's in your Occult Deck.

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:12.600
Here I go!

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:14.260
I set a card!

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:19.640
And I summon Goblin Zombie in attack position!

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:20.970
I end my turn!

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:22.970
My turn!

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:24.200
I draw!

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:27.420
I set a card.

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:31.050
I summon Drillago!

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:33.280
Attack his monster!

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:38.500
I activate the trap card Fearful Earthbound!

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:40.490
Trap?

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:42.990
Look at your feet.

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:47.280
This is...

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:56.060
My weak monster acted as a decoy so that I could activate Fearful Earthbound.

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:58.200
Fearful Earthbound.

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:03.710
The opponent takes 500 points of damage every time his monster attacks.

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:08.620
I can't stop my monster's attack!

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:12.350
I don't care if you destroy my weak monster.

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:19.090
The more monsters in my graveyard, the more powerful my Occult Deck becomes.

00:10:23.940 --> 00:10:27.300
My Continuous Trap Card's effect activates!

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:30.660
Earthbound, eat him!

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:34.840
Too bad.

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:38.820
I activate the spell card Remove Trap!

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:49.190
Remove Trap negates Earthbound!

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:52.760
He had a card to erase the trap.

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:54.600
By the way, Bakura...

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:56.660
Look at yourself.

00:10:56.940 --> 00:10:57.670
What?

00:10:58.640 --> 00:10:59.770
What?

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:04.420
You're the one who was eaten.

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:07.140
What's going on?

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:11.350
This is a shadow duel.

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:12.520
What?

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:16.530
Due to my attack, you lost life points.

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:23.400
In this Shadow Game, the shadows devour your body for every life point you lose.

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:24.660
The shadows?

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:29.370
So there are spirits who devour souls hiding in these shadows.

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:36.310
I see.

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:39.280
This game is very entertaining!

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:45.230
When you lose all your life points, the shadows will completely devour your body and soul.

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:47.450
It's a game of death!

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.000
How fun!

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:52.520
Whoever runs out of life points becomes one with the shadows.

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:55.530
Who will erase the other first?

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:58.530
Let's fight, Bakura!

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:28.120
Where am I?

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:32.470
I'm inside my heart.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:42.870
I sense something bad in my other self's room.

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:48.180
It's been a while since I entered my other self's room.

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:54.370
Nothing has changed.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.720
It's a complex 3-D maze.

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:01.510
What's wrong, partner?

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:03.120
My other self.

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:06.160
Did you sleepwalk into my room?

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.460
Phew.  You scared me.

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:11.770
Sorry.  So what's up?

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:16.770
Well, I sensed something weird in your room.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:20.240
Yeah.  I've sensed it for a while too.

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:26.260
I didn't understand this maze the last time I came here, but I think I understand now.

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:29.320
You don't have your memories.

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:35.320
This room represents your heart, not knowing which way to go.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:36.600
Partner...

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:41.400
But I'll get your memories back.

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:44.200
That's my duty.

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:51.710
Who will the shadows devour first?

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:53.450
How fun!

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:54.940
Let's fight, Marik!

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:55.780
I draw!

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:59.510
Choose your card carefully, Bakura.

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:03.680
I already know what's in your Occult Deck.

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:12.910
If he knows my Occult Deck, I can't use Destiny Board.

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:17.600
I must use a strategy that he knows nothing about.

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:18.970
Bring it on.

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:25.440
The Winged Dragon of Ra in my deck will end your life.

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:28.040
What's wrong?

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:30.010
Keep your cool.

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:33.750
Marik has one monster on his field.

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:36.750
If he already has a God Card in his hand...

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:41.630
He'll summon the God when he has three monsters to tribute.

00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:44.250
Don't be afraid of a God, Bakura!

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:46.700
Be quiet!  Don't talk!

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:47.530
Listen.

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.680
There's a way to defeat Ra.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:51.700
What?

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:55.700
Are you taking time to strategize again?

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:58.710
It's pointless to resist.  Hurry up!

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:01.920
I see.  That can work.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.570
Enjoy it, Marik.

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:10.080
Thanks to your advice, I'll completely destroy your body.

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:11.720
I don't care!  Do it!

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:15.790
What did my other personality tell him?

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:18.530
I set two cards!

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:21.960
I summon a monster to defend with!

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:24.500
I end my turn!

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:27.230
What's he thinking?

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:32.410
No matter what they're planning, all is powerless against a God Card.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:36.410
But I don't have The Winged Dragon of Ra in my hand yet.

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:38.300
I draw a card!

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:42.450
I'll use this spell card to draw my God.

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:46.250
I activate the spell card Card of Sanctity!

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:48.370
A spell that powers up his hand!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:49.500
Correct!

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:52.530
We both draw until we have six cards in our hands.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:04.480
I can tell that you weren't able to draw The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:06.580
Then I'll help you!

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.880
I flip over my set card!

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:10.480
Multiple Destruction!

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:13.710
What?

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:18.220
Multiple Destruction sends all the cards in our hands to our graveyards.

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:21.620
Then we draw five new cards.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:31.820
But since I activated this trap, I lose 100 life points for every card that I discarded.

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:36.870
Why does he want me to draw the God Card so badly?

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:39.960
What's the matter?  Hurry up and draw!

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:45.540
Still nothing.

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:48.690
What?  You still couldn't draw it?

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:49.550
Pathetic!

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:54.290
I set one card and end my turn.

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:59.290
Do you remember that someone visited here before?

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:01.660
Shadi!

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:05.650
He used the Millennium Key to come here.

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:11.000
He learned that there's a door to enter my "real room" somewhere in this maze.

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:25.840
But he couldn't find your real room.

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:31.560
Correct.  Even I don't know where the door is.

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:37.570
It's nearly impossible to find that room in this complex maze.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:41.640
Shadi appeared again on the Battle Ship.

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:49.500
Everything needed to open the door to the Pharaoh's memories are on the Battle Ship.

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:58.100
Perhaps the door to the Pharaoh's memories refers to your real room inside this maze.

00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:01.500
I can't afford to lose this duel.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:05.680
Partner, I promise to win!

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:09.900
So that I'll acquire everything I need to open my door!

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:15.060
I'll fight alongside you!

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:15.930
Right.

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:19.910
My turn!

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:21.540
I draw a card!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:25.380
This is what I was waiting for!

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:31.180
I tribute Gernia to summon Puppet Master!

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:38.300
I activate Puppet Master's effect!

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:45.680
By paying 1000 life points, I can bring three monsters in my graveyard back to my field.

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:57.010
Monsters Special Summoned by Puppet Master can't attack this turn.

00:18:57.250 --> 00:19:00.010
I know.  Take it easy.

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:04.750
I'll use this spell card to give you a nice present.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:05.700
What?

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:09.200
I activate the spell card Dark Designator!

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:15.430
Dark Designator lets you select one monster card and add it to my hand.

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:16.430
Are you...

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:21.500
Yes.  I'll let you add the Ra card in your deck to your hand.

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:30.240
How does it feel to finally get Ra?

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:33.680
I finally understand.

00:19:33.680 --> 00:19:38.650
Why you wanted me to draw Ra so badly.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:42.890
Come to think of it, your field provided a hint.

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:49.400
You were willing to pay 1000 life points to summon three weak monsters.

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:53.120
And you have one set card.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:57.240
You're trying to take my Ra card.

00:19:57.570 --> 00:19:59.840
You've figured it out too late!

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:02.000
I flip over my set card!

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:03.740
Exchange activates!

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:04.960
I thought so.

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:10.980
Due to Exchange, we swap one card in our hands with each other.

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:14.050
Hand over your Ra card!

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:32.240
He took a good card.

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:40.310
Since you wanted to see The Winged Dragon of Ra so badly, I'll show it to you next turn.

00:20:42.780 --> 00:20:44.730
YOU will show me?

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:48.000
You're wrong, Bakura.

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:50.560
You can't control Ra.

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:54.290
It's your teacher who can bring out Ra.

00:20:54.680 --> 00:21:02.700
Only those who can chant the hieratic text correctly can summon The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.200
That's right.

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:10.770
It means you're not a worthy opponent unless you get help.

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:11.510
What?

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:13.510
But it's fine.

00:21:13.510 --> 00:21:16.040
I'll let you have that handicap.

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:21.020
Say whatever you want.  I'll be the one laughing in the end!

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:26.580
Let's continue the duel.

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:31.800
We'll summon The Winged Dragon of Ra next turn and finish you!

00:21:43.450 --> 00:21:47.140
Bakura summons The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:54.270
But Marik's dark side uses a trap to lower the tributed monsters' attack points to 0.

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:56.970
That means Ra also has 0 attack points?

